{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JDG","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"士师记","commonName":"士师记","title":"士师记","order":7,"numberOfChapters":21,"sha256":"b41549e1798366ee29bb3d2292f8b33fc93f2b80c2c101beb91358b529c88503","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JDG/1.json","lastChapterNumber":21,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JDG/21.json","totalNumberOfVerses":616},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["底波拉和巴拉之歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那一天，底波拉和亚比挪庵的儿子巴拉高唱凯歌："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"“以色列的首领身先士卒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"民众前仆后继，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要赞美耶和华！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"君王啊，请听！首领啊，请侧耳听！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要向耶和华歌唱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要歌颂以色列的上帝耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，当你从西珥出来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"走过以东时，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地震动，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天上下雨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"云降雨水。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在西奈山的耶和华面前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在以色列的上帝耶和华面前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"群山震动。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在亚拿的儿子珊迦与雅亿的时代，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大路行人绝迹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"旅客绕道前行。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我底波拉做以色列之母以前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的乡村杳无人烟。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列人选择新的神明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"便战祸临门，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"四万以色列人中找不到一矛一盾。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的心追随以色列的首领，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"追随民中踊跃出征的人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要赞美耶和华！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"“你们骑白驴的、坐绣花毯子的、步行的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都要倾听。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"歌乐手聚集在井旁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"传扬耶和华和祂以色列子民的胜利。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华的子民都来到城门口。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"“底波拉啊，来吧，来吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"歌唱吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亚比挪庵的儿子巴拉啊，来吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"带走你的战俘吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"幸存的以色列人响应他们的首领，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华的子民为我攻击勇士。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们有些来自原属亚玛力人的以法莲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有些来自便雅悯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"统领出自玛吉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将官出自西布伦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以萨迦的首领与底波拉同往，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以萨迦人随巴拉同去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"众人一起冲进山谷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吕便人却犹豫不决。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吕便人为什么坐在羊圈中听悠悠笛声？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们举棋不定。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"基列人留在约旦河东岸。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但人为什么停留在船上？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亚设人在海岸静坐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在港口逗留。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但西布伦人舍生忘死，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拿弗他利人拼死鏖战沙场。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"“迦南诸王来战，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"来到米吉多河边的他纳交战，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却没有掠走金银。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"星辰从天上争战，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从它们的轨道攻击西西拉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"古老的基顺河冲走了敌人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的心啊，要奋勇向前！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蹄声隆隆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"骏马疾驰！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"“耶和华的天使说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘要咒诅米罗斯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要重重地咒诅米罗斯的居民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们没有帮助耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"没有帮助耶和华攻击强敌。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"text":"“基尼人希百的妻子雅亿是妇人中最有福的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是住帐篷的妇人中最有福的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"西西拉求水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅亿给他奶喝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用珍贵的碗盛上奶酪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅亿左手拿起橛子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"右手拿起工匠的锤子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猛击西西拉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打碎了他的头，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"刺透了他的太阳穴。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"西西拉屈身倒下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"死在她脚前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一动不动地躺在那里。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"text":"“西西拉的母亲凭窗远眺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"隔着窗棂喊道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘为什么他的战车迟迟不回？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为什么还听不到车轮声？’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聪明的宫女安慰她，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她却依然自言自语，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘莫非他们在搜索、瓜分战利品？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"每人得到一两个少女，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"西西拉分得绣花彩巾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"绣花的彩色围巾作战利品。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿你的敌人都像西西拉一样灭亡！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿爱你的人都如升起的太阳，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"光辉熠熠！”","poem":1},"此后，以色列安享太平四十年。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JDG/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JDG/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JDG/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":31}